  "title": "Region 24 Chronicle",
  "subtitle": "June 2, 2026 - Regional Dispatch and Market Notes",
  "main_story": {
    "headline": "Travelers Question Stone Gate Toll Rates",
    "lede": "Local passage fees became the subject of debate among commuters yesterday morning.",
    "body": "Regional traffic flows encountered a minor administrative confusion regarding the *Stone Gate* tolls. **Dera** reported the current fee at 8 *copper* based on a personal transaction.\n\n**Fenn** challenged this account, citing posted information listing the cost at 10 *copper*. **Dera** reiterated having paid the lower sum earlier in the day.\n\n**Fenn** concluded the exchange by noting the absence of official confirmation from the gatekeeper on either amount. Travelers are advised to verify rates independently until further notice."
  }
}

